\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian lat remains weak,cbank seen active-dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 August 1999\par 10:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      RIGA, Aug 25 (Reuters) - The Latvian lat was weak in early \par \par \uc2  Wednesday trade amid continuing dollar demand and signs of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2      "It's much the same as yesterday, there are no fresh signs \par \par \uc2  on the makret, we are at \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels, so the (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is in the market again," said one dealer, adding \par \par \uc2  there were no signs of foreign positions taken against the lat. \par \par \uc2  "It is mostly corporates buying and demand from the \par \par \uc2  street...but it is a bit smaller so maybe this street-level \par \par \uc2  demand will calm down. Actually the volumes of dollars being \par \par \uc2  bought are not large," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At 0825 GMT the market's offered dollar rate\tab   was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0.5933 against the lat while the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's rate, which is\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate, was also 0.5933\tab  .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The lat has remained weak for the past month since the\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for the first time this year amid\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  worries originally sparked by a gaping budget deficit.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Recent local media reports of comments by Ventspils Mayor\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Aivars Lembergs - who had said he was moving municipal funds\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par into dollars due to lat worries - hit retail-level sentiment\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par last week, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Intermittent dollar weakness abroad has further driven down\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par already weak lat sentiment due to bargain hunting for the U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par unit.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The lat is pegged at 0.7997 lats to the SDR, the IMF's world\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par basket \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par percent either side.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  does not usually enter the market when the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lat is safely within the band but steps in more or less\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par automatically when it threatens to leave.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reuters@reuters.lv)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv8p01ysr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
