\par\par \b \uc2  INTERVIEW-World Bank sees budget key to stable lat. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Burton Frierson \par \uc2 566 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 1999\par 15:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Aug 20 (Reuters) - Latvia should take more steps to cut the 1999 fiscal deficit, which will be the key to ensuring the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stability, the World Bank said on Friday. \par \par \uc2  In an interview with Reuters, the World Bank's country director for Poland and the Baltic states, Basil Kavalsky, also said Latvian 1999 GDP growth would be "almost flat", 2000's two percent and between four and six percent in 2001. \par \par \uc2  Russia's financial crisis last year pushed Latvia into a recession that has put a strangle hold on budget revenues, creating a burgeoning fiscal deficit that has led to retail level worries over the lat's stability. \par \par \uc2  Parliament approved a 27.95 million lat package of budget spending cuts two weeks ago, but they were less than half of what the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said should be trimmed and will still leave a fiscal deficit of 3.5 percent of GDP. \par \par \uc2  "There's no doubt that this (deficit) remains somewhat too high in this situation. So there's another round of cuting I'm affraid," Kavalsky said. \par \par \uc2  Last month \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time this year, selling dollars to support a lat weakened by worries on the retail level that the deficit was undermining the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Some of the steps that the government took in relation to reducing (expenditures) on the pensions were a step in the right direction and I hope those steps would be maintained," Kavalsky said. \par \par \uc2  "But there will have to be additional steps as well. This is, I think, the key to the stability of the lats and to the success of the (IMF) programme." \par \par \uc2  Latvia's memorandum with the IMF ran out in the spring as the government and the fund postponed talks on a new one until a clearer picture of budget revenues emerged. \par \par \uc2  "I think its very critical that the government and IMF reach agreement on such a programme, and we are confident that if agreement can be reached the overall outlook is a positve one," Kavalsky said. \par \par \uc2  Talks on a new memorandum are to begin in September. \par \par \uc2  Latvia's economy contracted by 1.9 percent in the fourth quarter and 2.3 percent in the first three months this year, due to the slump in exports caused by last year's rouble devaluation in Russia, once Latvia's mainstay market. \par \par \uc2  Kavalsky said 1999 GDP would be almost flat or see "perhaps a very small decline" but that signs of improvement in Russia and Western Europe gave reason for optimism beyond that. \par \par \uc2  Latvia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has forecast 1999 GDP growth at between one and two percent \par \par \uc2  "Next year the growth rate will still be modest but I think there is potential on the up side of that forecast actually," Kavalsky said. \par \par \uc2  Along with Russia's decline, analysts say sluggishness in Western Europe has hurt efforts of companies to redirect sales there. \par \par \uc2  "Clearly the situation in Russia has bottomed out, and there is some expansion in the Russian economy," Kavalsky said. \par \par \uc2  "The European economies are looking much more promising in the year ahead and both those are very positive signs for the Latvian economy and trade here in Latvia." \par \par \uc2  ((Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, riga.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv8k027x3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
