\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian dealers see signs of c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 341 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 1999\par 14:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Aug 6 (Reuters) - Latvian dealers said on Friday they saw more signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as a weak dollar abroad and budget worries continued to feed dollar demand. \par \par \uc2  "I think the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  today," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  "It's quite active today and there have been some sellers of dollars, which haven't been around for two days, but the situation is the same as yesterday - dollar/lat is at \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the dealer added. \par \par \uc2  At 1205 GMT the market's offered dollar rate was 0.5908 against the lat and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate, which is its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, was 0.5909. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  no longer comments daily on whether it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Last month saw a spate of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid worries, mostly on the retail level, that the country's gaping budget deficit could undermine the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stability. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday and Thursday and that deficit worries had been revived after opposition MPs managed to postpone the implementation of amendments to the pension law aimed at bolstering next year's budget. \par \par \uc2  Latvia's parliament on Thursday approved a package of 27.95 million lats ($47 million) in cuts to the 1999 state budget, which was less than originally planned. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 lats to the SDR, the IMF's world basket \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one percent either side. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not generally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  while the lat remains safely within its corridor, but steps in more or less automatically when it threatens to leave its fluctuation band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's offered rates represent the widest points in the band. \par \par \uc2  Dealers have said they still saw no signs of foreign players taking speculative positions against the lat but Friday was the first day of good local dollar supply. \par \par \uc2  ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, reuters@reuters.lv)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv86035lg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
