\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in small amounts-dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 320 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 1999\par 10:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Aug 4 (Reuters) - Dealers said \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday as a weak dollar abroad fed corporate demand for the U.S. unit. \par \par \uc2  "We bought some (dollars) from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but it's not big volumes," Sandris Pavlovs, a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Hansabanka, told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  At 0844 the market's offered dollar rate was 0.5902 against the lat and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was also 0.5902. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official declined to comment on whether it had entered the market and said it would no longer comment daily on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Last month the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw a five-day spate of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid worries, mostly on the retail level, that the country's gaping budget deficit could undermine the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stability. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 lats to the SDR, the IMF's world basket \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one percent either side. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not generally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  while the lat remains safely within its corridor, but steps in more or less automatically when it threatens to leave its fluctuation band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's offered rates represent the widest points in the band. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they still saw no signs of foreign players taking speculative positions against the lat. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar is cheaper than it was a month ago and companies that wanted to buy dollars kept this demand until now and now they are buying cheap dollars," said Unibanka dealer Kristaps Strazds. \par \par \uc2  Latvia's parliament on Thursday will vote on a package of 27.95 million lats ($47 million) in cuts to the 1999 state budget, which is seen as key to shoring up lat stability in the medium term. \par \par \uc2  ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, reuters@reuters.lv)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv840391y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
