\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian c.bank says no  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  so far. \b0\par\par\uc2 328 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1999\par 11:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, July 30 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market so far in Friday trade as the lat seemed to be firming after a recent bout of weakness brought on by budget deficit worries. \par \par \uc2  "(There has been) no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  so I guess the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  cycle is over because the spread between the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate and the interbank market rate has widened," said Karlis Bauze, a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0945, the market's offered dollar rate was 0.5911 against the lat and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.5917. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although volumes were small, and before that it was on the market for a stretch of five trading days that ended on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 lats to the SDR, the IMF's world basket \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one percent either side. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not generally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  while the lat remains safely within its corridor, but steps in more or less automatically when it threatens to leave its fluctuation band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not disclose the levels at which it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  but its offered rates represent the widest points in the band. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time this year amid worries, mostly on the retail level, that the budget deficit could undermine the lat's stability. \par \par \uc2  Latvia's parliament on Thursday approved a package of 27.95 million lats ($47 million) in cuts to the 1999 state budget in their first reading and set a second and final vote for August 5. The cuts were far short of the original 45.5 million lats in cuts the government had said it was planning. \par \par \uc2  ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, reuters@reuters.lv)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7u03int\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
