\par\par \b \uc2  Latvian c.bank says no  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  so far today. \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juli 1999\par 13:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, July 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market so far on Tuesday after five straight trading days of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  through Monday to support a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened by budget woes. \par \par \uc2  "No, actually the interbank market is something like 10 basis points (stronger) than our rates so we are off the market," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer Karlis Bauze told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  At 1136 GMT the market's offered dollar rate was 0.5948 against the lat and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.5955. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time this year a week ago amid worries, mostly on the retail level, that the country's budget deficit could undermine the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stability. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged at 0.7997 lats to the SDR, the IMF's world basket \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and is allowed to fluctuate in a band of one percent either side. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not generally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  while the lat remains safely within its corridor, but steps in more or less automatically when it threatens to leave its fluctuation band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not disclose the levels at which it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  but its offered rates represent the widest points in the band. \par \par \uc2  The new government, which took over earlier this month after the previous one resigned amid criticism of its handling of the budget, has pledged to cut the deficit to shore up the lat's economic fundametals. \par \par \uc2  ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, reuters@reuters.lv)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7r03rq1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
