\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Latvian cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  for fourth day. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Burton Frierson \par \uc2 491 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juli 1999\par 12:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, July 23 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the fourth day in a row to support the lat, which remained weak amid budget deficit worries despite government plans of large spending cuts to bolster the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, analysts said the lat was not in imminent danger of devaluation and expected finance ministry plans of about 50 million lats ($84 million) in 1999 budget cuts to reassure markets and lat pessimists on the retail level. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer Karlis Bauze told Reuters the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  again \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday after entering the market for the first time this year on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "Yes, we did (enter the market)...we did one small \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it was very light,". \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged to the SDR at 0.7997 and fluctuates in a band of plus/minus one percent. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively to support the lat but acts as a supplier of last resort in \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  when market rates overshoot either side of the fluctuation band. \par \par \uc2  Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came despite new Finance Minister Edmunds Krastinsh's announcement that the government was eying some 50 million lats in budget spending cuts. \par \par \uc2  "The budget expenditure cuts of almost 50 million lats would affect almost all branches," Krastinsh told Latvian Radio, adding that Latvia's 1999 deficit would range from three to five percent of GDP depending on privatisation revenue. \par \par \uc2  The new government, which took over last week after former Prime Minister Vilis Krishtopans resigned amid sharp criticism over his handling of the budget, has pledged to cut the budget to shore up the economic foundations of the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Krastinsh also said Latvia expected to tap international debt markets next year and would draft a 2000 budget based on conservative 3.5 percent GDP growth and 3.0 percent inflation. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said it remained to be seen whether the government would have to cut more than the 50 million lats Krastinsh expected in 1999, but added that it was a good start. \par \par \uc2  Earlier projections had been for cuts of 40-80 million lats. \par \par \uc2  "In this turbulent situation I'd say this was quite a good introductory step and perhaps the government will follow with even more if the markets push them to do so...(but) the absolute levels of borrowing are relatively low even compared to some emerging markets," said Hansabank Markets analyst Urmas Riel. \par \par \uc2  "At least the trend should be well-perceived by the markets," Riel added. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said it would take time for the news to bolster the lat. \par \par \uc2  "Generally (lat \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is not over yet, but of course the amounts are small, it's mainly local market demand, no international demand," said Janis Strazinskis, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money market dealer with Vereinsbank. \par \par \uc2  ($1 = 0.5974 Latvian lats) \par \par \uc2  ((Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, reuters@reuters.lv)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7n03ups\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
