\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Latvia \highlight\uc2  c.bank says no lat  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  so far. \b0\par\par\uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juli 1999\par 10:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, July 23 (Reuters) - The Latvian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market so far in early Friday trade after three days of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Tuesday to Thursday as the lat sagged amid worries about the budget deficit. \par \par \uc2  "The amounts (of dollar sales this week) were decreasing every day and today we are off the market," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer Karlis Bauze said. \par \par \uc2  In early Friday trade the lat was still low. At 0824 GMT the offered dollar rate was 0.5980 against the lat and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.5977. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Latvia entered the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time this year on Tuesday as the lat weakened against the SDR basket of world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to which it is pegged, amid worries over the economy and a gaping budget deficit. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged to the SDR at 0.7997 and fluctuates in a band of plus/minus one percent. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively to support the lat but acts as a supplier of last resort in \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  when market rates overshoot either side of the fluctuation band. \par \par \uc2  It does not disclose the levels at which it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  but its offered rates represent the widest points in the band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  last year as the lat sagged amid worries over the effects of the Russian economic crisis, and raised interest rates to protect the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  This year it has gradually relaxed rates in a bid to revive the interbank market, which all but dried up after the Russian crisis struck last August, and said on Thursday it saw no reason to raise rates despite the current lat weakness. \par \par \uc2  ((Burton Frierson, Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, reuters@reuters.lv)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7n03u8r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
