\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Latvian cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 , sees no rate hike. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Burton Frierson \par \uc2 540 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 1999\par 12:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, July 22 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday for the third day in a row to support the lat but said it did not plan a rate hike to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has weakened recently amid budget deficit worries. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said that since dollar demand volumes were low and the pressure seemed purely local the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could relax for now, but the market will be watching for the government to cut the gaping budget deficit that is keeping the lat soft. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Latvia \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer Karlis Bauze told Reuters the bank was again in the market after buying "small amounts during the whole day" on Wednesday and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time this year on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "That's right, we're doing it again...but in much smaller amounts than yesterday. But, we are in the market," Bauze said. \par \par \uc2  The lat is pegged to the SDR basket of world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 0.7997 and fluctuates in a band of plus/minus one percent. At 1010 GMT the market's offered dollar rate was 0.5995 against the lat and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate was 0.5991. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively to support the lat, but it acts as a supplier of last resort in \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  when market rates overshoot either side of the fluctuation band. Its offered rates represent the widest points in the band. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  last year, as the lat sagged amid worries over the effects of the Russian economic crisis, and raised interest rates to protect the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, Helmuts Ancans, head of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary policy department, told Reuters this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was driven more by excess liquidity than pressure and HE saw no rate rises. \par \par \uc2  "We do not expect any changes in the money market related to this and we do not want to induce any changes right now," Ancans said. \par \par \uc2  "It's really miserable amounts that we have been selling, so its not really a massive attack or something of that kind and so we are not really worried about that. It's just a regular adjustment and nothing more than that," he added. \par \par \uc2  Local analysts said foreign banks had so far not appeared to take up positions against the lat, as they did in earlier unsuccessful bids to take the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down during the 1997 emerging markets shakeup and last year's Russian crisis. \par \par \uc2  "I don't think (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should raise rates) because this pressure is not very serious...but of course if significant pressure comes from foreign players I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will increase rates," said Druvis Murmanis, head of Hansabank Markets in Latvia. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the current pressure on the lats did not look like a serious threat of devaluation, but that much hinged on the government's handling of the deficit. \par \par \uc2  The new government of Prime Minister Andris Shkele, which took over last week after his predecessor Vilis Krishtopans resigned over his handling of the budget, has pledged spending cuts to shore up the lat's economic foundation. \par \par \uc2  ((Riga Newsroom +371 722 2079, reuters@reuters.lv)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7m040c8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
