\par\par \b \uc2  C.bank sees lats stable, confirms  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 168 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 1998\par 18:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Aug 28 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday the stability of the lat \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not threatened by Latvian banks' exposure to Russian debt. \par \par \uc2  But in a news conference, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Einars Repshe said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  recently. \par \par \uc2  "We have sold small dollar sums in recent days," Repshe said. \par \par \uc2  "Lats stability is in no way threatened and I would suggest people who do not need dollars should wait with buying. It will simply be cheaper when the demand falls," Repshe said. \par \par \uc2  The bank said it had ample resources to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is pegged to the SDR - a special monetary unit of the International Monetary Fund made up of major world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  - and is 100 percent backed by reserves. \par \par \uc2  "In a couple days or weeks lats will return to the lower border of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band," he added. \par \par \uc2  ((Riga newsroom +371 722 2079, riga.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8s01soh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
