\par\par \b \uc2  LATVIA-O/N RATES STEADY, LAT IN DEMAND. \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 September 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  RIGA, Sept 19 (Reuter) - Latvian overnight rates remained steady on Friday but dealers expected them to edge up next week when banks scramble to meet their end of the month reserve requirements. \par \par \uc2  On the the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, increased stock market activity was seen driving demand for the lat but it eased against the dollar, which rose sharply on global markets on Thursday night, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Overnight rates were virtually unchanged at a bid ask range of 1.70/2.50. \par \par \uc2  "Things have been very quiet all week and rates have hardly changed a notch," said Maris Vinklers of Hansabank-Latvija's money market's department. \par \par \uc2  "The market should be more active next week when banks try to make their reserve requirements for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was relatively busy as investors playing the reinvigorated bourse snapped up lats. \par \par \uc2  Latvian shares eased this week but trade volumes remained high. \par \par \uc2  "There is a big demand for lats now which is linked to the rally on the stock market," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  But the dollar's overnight surge knocked the lat down a bit. \par \par \uc2  The lat/dollar rate eased to the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of 0.5816/20 on Friday morning from Thursday's close of 0.5805/15. \par \par \uc2  -- Ed Stoddard, Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040131dt9j00g1v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
