\par\par \b \uc2  Exotic  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2 /Latvia -2: Pegged To SDR Basket \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 1996\par 17:01\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Since February 1994, the lat has formally been pegged to the International Monetary Fund's (IMF) Special Drawing Rights (SDR) \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket. This means the lat exchange rate changes only when other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the the SDR basket fluctuate. One SDR is equal to 0.7997 lats. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, one U.S. dollar was worth 0.547 lats, a rate unchanged for nearly a year, except for the period when the U.S. dollar weakened against the SDR last spring. \par \par \uc2  Even during the height of the banking crisis in 1995, the lat held against the SDR, sparing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Latvia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , from having to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Though the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained unscathed, the banking crisis has damaged investor confidence in the country, widened an already widening budget deficit and dashed expectations of economic growth. \par \par \uc2  And while this legacy leaves the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable, it doesn't spell a great deal of investor confidence in the country. \par \par \uc2  "It's a bad memory that will inhibit things," said Viksnins, referring to the lingering effects of the banking crisis. "I certainly wouldn't put $1,000 in a bank in Latvia." \par \par \uc2  According to a report on Latvia by Union Bank of Switzerland, the country lags Estonia in attracting foreign capital. The blame for this is divided between the slow pace of privatization and lingering doubts about the banking system. \par \par \uc2  Viksnins, however, emphasizes that the banking crisis had unforeseen \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  benefits as it curbed speculative capital that could have entered the country to take advantage of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's anti-inflationary, high interest rates. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 08-29-96 \par \par \uc2  1101EDT \par \par \uc2  1149 1802 1838 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011013ds8t00k34\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (latvia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\br